<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf-model-fidelity-1> a pk1:EvidenceItem ;
    rdfs:label "2011-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf.py L417–L523" ;
    dct:description "integrate_margin_outgrowth: material-polyline radial-growth integrator (rate k_allometric + kappa_n * (v_n - <v_n>), outward normal term, arclength resampling) and dissection_index_radial (find_peaks on log R, I_D = 0 when no lateral tooth)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2011-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf.py#L417-L523> .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf-model-fidelity-2> a pk1:EvidenceItem ;
    rdfs:label "2011-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf.py L654–L1137" ;
    dct:description "GrowingLaminaSpringMesh: symmetric half-mesh Delaunay + mirror (L738-863), screened-Poisson growth field, Mitchison canalization (L905-927), vein topology (L929-947), anisotropic growth tensors (L949-997), relaxation (L999-1025), run/summary" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2011-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf.py#L654-L1137> .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf-model-fidelity-3> a pk1:EvidenceItem ;
    rdfs:label "morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_037_allometric_compound_leaf.lean L164–L224" ;
    dct:description "hamant_2008_microtubule_anisotropic_growth_partition (gamma_par + gamma_perp = 2gS, gamma_par - gamma_perp = 2gaS > 0) and mitchison_1980_canalization_conductance_feedback (D' > D above threshold, D' < D at zero flux); file verifies with 0 sorrys" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_037_allometric_compound_leaf.lean#L164-L224> .

