    dct:description "20 measurements: Laws 1-3 residuals, antiphase r, emergent I_D for cuc2-1/At/Ch, emergent 6-genotype r (ref 1.0, Pass 2 value withdrawn), Ch/At contrast ratio (1.10 vs 3.44), stage monotonicity, sweep ceiling, mesh vein drainage, cuc2-1 veins, MT-ablation delta, axial stretch ratio, inverted elements, residual force, Hamant/Mitchison identities, specimen lobes and I_D" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2011-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf.py#L1339-L1570> .

